  "Requests about active trades or pending withdrawals are prioritised where possible. For your security, we will never ask for your full password or 2FA codes via unsolicited emails.": "Zahteve o aktivnih poslih ali dvigih v teku imajo prednost, kjer je to mogoče. Zaradi vaše varnosti ne bomo nikoli zahtevali vašega celotnega gesla ali kod 2FA prek nezaželene e-pošte.",
