  "Third-party content or links may be included but are not guaranteed for accuracy or availability; please verify independently.": "Vsebina ali povezave tretjih oseb so lahko vključene, vendar ni zagotovljena njihova točnost ali razpoložljivost; preverite neodvisno.",
  "8. External Links": "8. Zunanje povezave",
  "External links are offered for convenience. We do not endorse or control these sites and accept no liability for their content.": "Za udobje so na voljo zunanje povezave. Teh spletnih mest ne podpiramo ali nadzorujemo in ne prevzemamo nobene odgovornosti za njihovo vsebino.",
